#. i18n: file: emailclientconfig_ui.ui:99
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkRunTerminal)
#: rc.cpp:55
msgid ""
"Activate this option if you want the selected email client to be executed in "
